    "title": "Diamondhead Attorney, 70, Jailed After Alleged Threats to Kill Federal Agents in Long Beach - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jackie Ramirez-Lopez ,\n8 hours ago A 70-year-old Florida attorney living in Diamondhead, Mississippi, is behind bars after federal agents say she tried to buy a gun specifically to kill an Immigration and Customs Enforcement officer. Lisa White was arrested in Long Beach on Sept. 24 following an investigation into threats against federal agents, and she remains jailed without bond while federal agents prepare charges. Read full article\n2",
